WEBVTT

00:00:29.817 --> 00:00:31.527
It keeps us bound ...

00:00:32.862 --> 00:00:35.531
so that we can't move into the future,

00:00:35.531 --> 00:00:38.868
because we're so busy
being tied to the past.

00:00:40.453 --> 00:00:41.913
So how do we get free?

00:00:43.498 --> 00:00:46.292
The freedom comes from our intuition.

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:49.295
The thing that's right here,

00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:52.006
you know, that you can't really
quite quantify.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.093
Sometimes, you can't
even really describe it.

00:00:55.635 --> 00:00:57.845
That intuition, that's the thing.

00:00:58.971 --> 00:01:02.934
Now I'm fortunate
to have had a career in marketing,